From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 14:48:25 +0200
Subject: ARM: dts: allwinner: sun8i-a83t: Add the ISP

The A83T has the same ISP as the V3s at 0x01cb8000, sharing the CSI's
bus clock, module clock, DRAM clock and reset.

It has no interrupt of its own. The vendor BSP gives it none either --
vfe_resource.h lists only SUNXI_IRQ_CSI for CONFIG_ARCH_SUN8IW6P1 -- and
there is no line left over on this SoC, with SPI 83 taken by MIPI CSI-2
and 85 by the CSI CCI. So the ISP node carries the CSI's SPI 84. Both
sun6i-isp and sun6i-csi request their interrupt with IRQF_SHARED, and
the ISP handler returns IRQ_NONE when none of its status bits are set,
so the two coexist on the line.

Wire the CSI's port@2 to the ISP, which is what makes sun6i-csi switch
itself into ISP mode. Both nodes stay disabled: the ISP is only useful
to boards with a raw bayer sensor, since the driver takes no other
input.

Signed-off-by: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a83t.dtsi | 37 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 37 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a83t.dtsi b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a83t.dtsi
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a83t.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/allwinner/sun8i-a83t.dtsi
@@ -1128,6 +1128,43 @@ csi_in_mipi_csi2: endpoint {
 						remote-endpoint = <&mipi_csi2_out_csi>;
 					};
 				};
+
+				port@2 {
+					reg = <2>;
+
+					csi_out_isp: endpoint {
+						remote-endpoint = <&isp_in_csi>;
+					};
+				};
+			};
+		};
+
+		isp: isp@1cb8000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun8i-a83t-isp";
+			reg = <0x01cb8000 0x1000>;
+			/*
+			 * The ISP has no interrupt of its own, it is wired to
+			 * the CSI line. Both drivers request it shared.
+			 */
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 84 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_CSI>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_CSI_SCLK>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_DRAM_CSI>;
+			clock-names = "bus", "mod", "ram";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_CSI>;
+			status = "disabled";
+
+			ports {
+				#address-cells = <1>;
+				#size-cells = <0>;
+
+				port@0 {
+					reg = <0>;
+
+					isp_in_csi: endpoint {
+						remote-endpoint = <&csi_out_isp>;
+					};
+				};
 			};
 		};
 
-- 
